{
  "file_id": "ID03566",
  "text_count": 185,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Sorry to keep you waiting, Lord\nVamdemon.",
      "_offset": 1366,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "This is a good spot to make our\nbase.",
      "_offset": 1416,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Now we just have to deal with the\neighth Chosen Child. Find them as\nsoon as possible.",
      "_offset": 1454,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Yes, sir!",
      "_offset": 1540,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Yes, sir!",
      "_offset": 1550,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Morning! Seems like there was an\nawful commotion around here.",
      "_offset": 1560,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "They've been talking about it\nnonstop on the morning news.",
      "_offset": 1622,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "So the only one we're still\nwaiting for would be...",
      "_offset": 1681,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Just Jou.",
      "_offset": 1733,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "What's he up to, anyway?",
      "_offset": 1743,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Let's wait until he gets here.",
      "_offset": 1768,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "It's been a while since I've been\nable to play soccer. I pulled off\nsome nice dribbles.",
      "_offset": 1799,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Even though you haven't been near\na ball in so long?",
      "_offset": 1887,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Yeah! All that training in the\nDigital World must have made me a\nbetter athlete.",
      "_offset": 1940,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Did you improve at soccer too,\nSora?",
      "_offset": 2021,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "I dunno. I haven't been able to\nget to a ball lately, so I really\nhave no idea.",
      "_offset": 2058,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "I wanna play soccer, too!",
      "_offset": 2138,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Okay, then let's have a match\nsomeday!",
      "_offset": 2164,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Yeah, sounds fun!",
      "_offset": 2203,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Soccer really is fun.",
      "_offset": 2221,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "It's a nice day out today. On a\nday like this, I want to go out\nfor a drive and play some music...",
      "_offset": 2243,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Is your dad busy with his job?",
      "_offset": 2342,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Would you take some lunch, too?",
      "_offset": 2373,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Yeah, he comes home and then goes\nright back.",
      "_offset": 2405,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "But I guess that's not really a\nbad thing...",
      "_offset": 2451,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Haha!",
      "_offset": 2496,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Yamatoooooo, I wanna ride in a car\ntoo!",
      "_offset": 2502,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Well, if we have time, we'll take\nyou driving.",
      "_offset": 2542,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Yay!",
      "_offset": 2589,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "B-U-T! Only if you're Tsunomon!",
      "_offset": 2594,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "We'd get into a pretty awkward\nsituation if I made lunch.",
      "_offset": 2626,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "The busier he gets, the more my\ndad pressures me about it...",
      "_offset": 2684,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "S-sorry. That wasn't very cool of\nme, saying something like that...",
      "_offset": 2749,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "My dad's going to be up all night\ntonight, too...",
      "_offset": 2817,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Ever since we got home, I've been\nbusy performing maintenance on my\ncomputer.",
      "_offset": 2867,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Is it that important to you?",
      "_offset": 2945,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "I couldn't repair anything in the\nDigimon world, after all...let\nalone find replacement parts.",
      "_offset": 2974,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "We're all the way here in the\nhuman world, but I've been stuck\nin his room the whole time...",
      "_offset": 3069,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Sorry, Tentomon.",
      "_offset": 3162,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "You really like computers, don't\nyou, Koushirou?",
      "_offset": 3179,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Yes. Would you consider that\nstrange?",
      "_offset": 3228,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "It's not strange at all!",
      "_offset": 3266,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "It might be a bit unusual...",
      "_offset": 3291,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I-is that so? That makes me kind\nof happy.",
      "_offset": 3320,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Your computer was a really huge\nhelp back when we were in the\nDigimon world.",
      "_offset": 3363,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "It's a privilege to be of\nassistance.",
      "_offset": 3440,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "I thought so...",
      "_offset": 3478,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Don't worry about it. It's good\nfor people to be a little unique.",
      "_offset": 3494,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Ahaha...",
      "_offset": 3560,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "I should buy a new computer soon.\nHmm...",
      "_offset": 3569,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "There really is no place like\nhome! I have food here and a nice,\ncool room!",
      "_offset": 3610,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "And when you open the fridge,\nthere's cola!",
      "_offset": 3686,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Mimi, you haven't even left the\nhouse once since we got back.",
      "_offset": 3730,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "You're tired from all that walking\nin the Digimon world, aren't you?",
      "_offset": 3792,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "I'm staying home this summer\nvacation! I won't take a single\nstep out the door!",
      "_offset": 3861,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Aren't you gonna get fat?",
      "_offset": 3941,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Not even if you were going overseas?",
      "_offset": 3967,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "You're right.",
      "_offset": 4012,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "You have to exercise, at least a\nlittle. How about soccer?",
      "_offset": 4026,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Ehhhhhhhhhhh, I'd prefer a more\ncasual sport.",
      "_offset": 4085,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Okay, then maybe I'd leave! If we\nwere going to Hawaii or something.",
      "_offset": 4131,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Hawaii's by the ocean, so you'll\nhave the chance to move around.",
      "_offset": 4200,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Nah, I wanna drink juice and lie\non the beach...",
      "_offset": 4265,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Ahaha, but that's not very\ndifferent from what you'd do at\nhome.",
      "_offset": 4314,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "But it's a good idea! I'll ask\nPapa.",
      "_offset": 4379,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "I'm spending my summer vacation\nrelaxing! This really is the best.",
      "_offset": 4416,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Sora! I'm gonna spend my vacation\nplaying at my grandma's house!",
      "_offset": 4483,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Oh, wow! Where does she live?",
      "_offset": 4548,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "She lives in Shimane.",
      "_offset": 4578,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Is Patamon coming with you?",
      "_offset": 4600,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Where's Shimane?",
      "_offset": 4628,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Yeah! Takeru's taking me with him.",
      "_offset": 4645,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "It'll be your first time in an\nairplane, right?",
      "_offset": 4680,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Of course! Being in a flying\nvehicle sounds fun.",
      "_offset": 4728,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Haha, sounds fun.",
      "_offset": 4777,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "It'll be lots of fun! I'm sure\nyou'll be surprised, Patamon!",
      "_offset": 4795,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "That's horrible, Sora!",
      "_offset": 4856,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "I *should* know, but it looks like\nit's slipped my mind.",
      "_offset": 4879,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Really?",
      "_offset": 4936,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Really. Shimane... Shimane?",
      "_offset": 4944,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Hmph!",
      "_offset": 4972,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "I wonder if Grandma's doing okay.",
      "_offset": 4978,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Heeeeeeeeeeeey!",
      "_offset": 5012,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Jou!",
      "_offset": 5028,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Sorry. I had a bit of a hard time\nfinding my old class roster.",
      "_offset": 5033,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Someone's clearly taking it easy.",
      "_offset": 5096,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "The eighth child witnessed the\nDigimon incident in Hikarigaoka\nfour years ago, just like we did.",
      "_offset": 5130,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "And furthermore, we should note\nthat they were in this area last\nnight.",
      "_offset": 5227,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Koushirou found a signal last\nnight.",
      "_offset": 5299,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "For that reason, I believe that\ntoday we should split up and try\nsearching this area.",
      "_offset": 5336,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Got it!",
      "_offset": 5422,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "That sounds good... even though\nit's burning hot out here.",
      "_offset": 5430,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "So what should I do with the\nroster I found?",
      "_offset": 5489,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "There's a high possibility that\nthe eighth child's name is in\nthere.",
      "_offset": 5534,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Please call each of them and ask\nthem if they were in Shibaura last\nnight.",
      "_offset": 5603,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "I have summer classes starting\ntomorrow. I'll take care of the\nphone calls as soon as possible...",
      "_offset": 5678,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "But let me stay home, instead of\ngoing out to look for them.",
      "_offset": 5776,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "That's not fair, Jou!",
      "_offset": 5837,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "I-I can't help it! I've got\nentrance exams!",
      "_offset": 5859,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Okay, then I'll give you my share\nas well. Here's the directory for\nWakaba Kindergarten.",
      "_offset": 5903,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Good idea! Here's the roster for\nFourth Elementary. Do a good job!",
      "_offset": 5992,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "It may be better to leave this all\nto one person.",
      "_offset": 6059,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Sounds like a plan. I'll leave\nthis to you, Jou.",
      "_offset": 6109,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Hey, hey...Taichi, not you too?",
      "_offset": 6158,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Don't worry! I'm not gonna make\nother people do my work.",
      "_offset": 6190,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "You're such a nice guy!",
      "_offset": 6247,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "I bet he actually just couldn't\nfind his directory.",
      "_offset": 6271,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Okay! Let's split up and find the\neighth child!",
      "_offset": 6323,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Good luck, everyone.",
      "_offset": 6371,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Ugh... Okay then, good luck, guys.",
      "_offset": 6392,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Let's look together, Takeru.",
      "_offset": 6427,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Okay! I'll go with you, Yamato!",
      "_offset": 6456,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Mimi, let's go search for the\neighth child together.",
      "_offset": 6488,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Okaaaaaaay!",
      "_offset": 6541,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Where are you going, Tailmon?",
      "_offset": 6553,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "To search for the eighth child.\nThat's our mission, right?",
      "_offset": 6583,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "Trying to take all the credit,\nhuh? You're always like that.",
      "_offset": 6642,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 6703,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "I'm the one who found the clue to \nthe eighth child! So I get to \nsearch this place! It's only fair!",
      "_offset": 6710,
      "_length": 100,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "You think the eighth child is\nalways going to stay in one place?",
      "_offset": 6811,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "If you think they've moved, then\ngo look somewhere else! Hahahaha!",
      "_offset": 6876,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "Hmph! You're just a little bat\nwho's always trying to kiss up to\nVamdemon!",
      "_offset": 6943,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "(Even when I was still in my Child\nform, Plotmon, Vamdemon always\nworked me to the bone.)",
      "_offset": 7018,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "(And if anything went wrong, he\nwould beat me up...)",
      "_offset": 7108,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "(Because he doesn't like my\neyes... I was born with them, I\ncan't help it...)",
      "_offset": 7161,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "(Born... I don't even remember\nwhere I was born...)",
      "_offset": 7239,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "(or what I was doing before I met\nVamdemon...)",
      "_offset": 7291,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "Tailmon...",
      "_offset": 7338,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "Ah!",
      "_offset": 7349,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "Reminiscing on old times?",
      "_offset": 7353,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "Wizarmon...",
      "_offset": 7379,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "Didn't I tell you not to read my\nmind without my permission?",
      "_offset": 7391,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "I apologize, I didn't mean to.",
      "_offset": 7452,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "I'm going to go look for the\neighth child...",
      "_offset": 7483,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "How are we supposed to look for\nthe eighth child?",
      "_offset": 7532,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "For now, we should ask people if\nthey've ever lived in Hikarigaoka.",
      "_offset": 7582,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "That sounds like a lot of work.",
      "_offset": 7650,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "~30 minutes later~",
      "_offset": 7682,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "Ah! There's a fast food joint over\nthere! Sora, why don't we rest up\nfor a bit?",
      "_offset": 7701,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "We have to take this seriously,\nMimi.",
      "_offset": 7781,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "Hmph...",
      "_offset": 7819,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "~After another 30 minutes~",
      "_offset": 7827,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "Why do I have to do this? We just\ngot home, and yet...",
      "_offset": 7854,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Sora, let's take a short break.",
      "_offset": 7909,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "Can't be helped, I guess.",
      "_offset": 7941,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Last night I was in a room with a\nfluffy bed and air conditioning!",
      "_offset": 7967,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "It's really great, being at\nhome...",
      "_offset": 8034,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "And the food was delicious...",
      "_offset": 8070,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "Yeah, yeah! It was the first time\nI ever thought Mama's cooking was\nso delicious.",
      "_offset": 8100,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "The food at Sora's house was\ndelicious, too. Sora's mom seems\nlike a very nice person.",
      "_offset": 8182,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "You think so? Thanks... Anyway,\nback to work, back to work...",
      "_offset": 8269,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "Sora, why don't we go someplace\nwhere lots of people gather?",
      "_offset": 8331,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "Where lots of people gather?",
      "_offset": 8392,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "Mmmmm! It's so nice and cool! I\nlove being in places with air\nconditioning!",
      "_offset": 8421,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "I *thought* you'd have an ulterior\nmotive...",
      "_offset": 8497,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "Woooow! This place is really\ncrowded.",
      "_offset": 8542,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "That's because it's a tourist\nattraction, you know.",
      "_offset": 8580,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "Hey, Sora, your house is over\nhere, right?",
      "_offset": 8632,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "Yeah. This is the world we live\nin.",
      "_offset": 8675,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "Mimi, isn't it a bit hot?",
      "_offset": 8711,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "Yeah. Maybe the air conditioning\ndoesn't work as well around here?",
      "_offset": 8737,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "Is the air conditioner broken?",
      "_offset": 8804,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 8835,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "english": "Gyaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 8849,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "english": "It's a Digimon!",
      "_offset": 8862,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "english": "RAAAAAAAAAAARGH!",
      "_offset": 8878,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "english": "Sora!",
      "_offset": 8895,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "english": "The only thing we can do is fight\nhim, Mimi!",
      "_offset": 8901,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "english": "We did it!",
      "_offset": 8946,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "english": "Whew. We managed to make it out of\nthat one... somehow.",
      "_offset": 8957,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "english": "But to think he'd appear in a\ntourist attraction, with so many\npeople around.",
      "_offset": 9013,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "english": "Let's hurry. We have to find the\neighth child.",
      "_offset": 9091,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "english": "They're a peaceful lot...",
      "_offset": 9138,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "english": "Miko! Where are you, Miko? Where\nare you...?",
      "_offset": 9164,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "english": "Are you Agumon's friend?",
      "_offset": 9212,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "english": "Ah, wait!",
      "_offset": 9237,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "english": "How did she know about Agumon?\nCould she be the eighth child?",
      "_offset": 9247,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "english": "(I really don't think she's a\nnormal kid. Best to just get rid\nof her now.)",
      "_offset": 9309,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "english": "It's you again!",
      "_offset": 9385,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "english": "C'mere...",
      "_offset": 9404,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "english": "Are you gonna come back again?",
      "_offset": 9417,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "english": "There isn't enough evidence that\nshe's the eighth child.",
      "_offset": 9448,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "english": "But why? That child... why do I\nget this feeling?",
      "_offset": 9505,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "english": "I wonder if Jou's coming after all.",
      "_offset": 9555,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "english": "We should wait for him together.",
      "_offset": 9591,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
